  "description": "A lightweight, plug-and-play HTTP request/response tracking library for ASP.NET Core.\nProvides a built-in real-time dashboard to monitor, search, and analyze all HTTP\ntransactions in your application. Supports SQL Server storage, async logging,\nautomatic log retention, and full integration via a single appsettings.json config block.\nSimply add AddNetTracker() and UseNetTracker() to your Program.cs to get started.",
